Package: deepblue-archive-keyring
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: DeepBlue Project <maintainer@deepblue.example>
Installed-Size: 8
Depends: gpgv
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: GnuPG archive key of the DeepBlue Linux archive
 Installs the public key used to verify packages from the DeepBlue
 Linux archive, so APT can validate the release "cobalt" without
 prompting. The matching private key never leaves the release
 engineering environment.
